SRR6795299	PRJNA436565	SRP133764	SAMN08628090	SRX3754316	Homo sapiens	haploid_hESC_library_Day30_rep1_run2	haploid_hESC_library_Day30_rep1_run2	NextSeq 500 sequencing: GSM3028272: haploid_hESC_library_Day30_rep1_run2 Homo sapiens OTHER	OTHER	GENOMIC	other	SINGLE	ILLUMINA	NextSeq 500	Genomic DNA was extracted with Blood & Cell Culture DNA Midi Kit (QIAGEN) according to manufacturer's instructions. The region containing the sgRNA integration was amplified with the following primers that also contain overhang sequences compatible for Nextera DNA library preparations (Illumina): 5'-TCGTCGGCAGCGTCAGATGTGTATAAGAGACAGGGCTTTATATATCTTGTGGAAAGGACG-3' (forward) and 5'-GTCTCGTGGGCTCGGAGATGTGTATAAGAGACAGACGGACTAGCCTTATTTTAACTTGC-3' (reverse). Total genomic DNA for each time point was divided into 50 µl PCR reactions with 4 µg DNA input. PCR settings were described previously51. After the purification of the 160 base pair product, a second PCR reaction was performed using Nextera adapter primers in order to generate Nextera DNA library according to manufacturer's instructions (Illumina). DNA libraries containing sgRNA constructs from two replicate experiments were sequenced using NextSeq 500 (Illumina) with 75 bp single-end reads.	29844051	2320628985	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR679/009/SRR6795299/SRR6795299.fastq.gz	0a6ed53c53beebc0a9a917c5f5693c2f	792555059
